{"transcript":"98-sharing-with-kumo","start":"2026-11-27T08:40:00.000Z","scenario":98,"title":"Sharing with Kumo","summary":"From another app's share sheet you share a job ad's link, with a note. The server reads the page for its title and summary, and Kumo puts the share in your open thread about that role, where it answers with what it made of it and what it did. Then you share a screenshot of a booking, which belongs to no thread, so Kumo starts one it names and answers there. Each reply notifies, naming its thread. The share sheet sends the first share again, and nothing changes.","guarantees":["G64"],"app":{"cursor":"e_0003_01777"}}
